{"title": "Light Sensitivity", "pageid": 11512, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Light_Sensitivity", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Sunlight_Sensitivity.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a2/Sunlight_Sensitivity.webp/300px-Sunlight_Sensitivity.webp, /w/images/a/a2/Sunlight_Sensitivity.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a2/Sunlight_Sensitivity.webp/300px-Sunlight_Sensitivity.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a2/Sunlight_Sensitivity.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Light Sensitivity</b> is a passive feature that causes penalties while in bright light.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>While in bright light, this creature has <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" title=\"Disadvantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/41px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/55px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disadvantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a> on <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Rolls\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Rolls\">Attack Rolls</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Perception\" title=\"Perception\">Perception</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Skill_Check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Skill Check\">Checks</a> that rely on sight. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Cloaker\" title=\"Cloaker\">Cloaker</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Meenlock\" title=\"Meenlock\">Meenlock</a></li></ul>\n</div>      \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714210747\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.027 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.031 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 612/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2811/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1475/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 16/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 181/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.003/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 643720/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   26.789      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   26.789      1 -total\n 33.83%    9.064      1 Template:Disadvantage\n 32.65%    8.746      1 Template:Icon_link\n 31.40%    8.412      1 Template:Icon_text\n 27.22%    7.293      2 Template:Trim\n 24.02%    6.434      1 Template:Ifempty\n 14.87%    3.983      1 Template:PageSeo\n 13.88%    3.718      1 Template:Main_namespace_only\n 13.77%    3.688      1 Template:Hidden_code\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:11512-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714210747 and revision id 168429. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n --